  },
  "checked_rows": 19,
  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00004",
      "text": "甲. 根据违法次数加重罚款的标准，适用于最近一年内（第二项丁目",
      "source_hash": "41e06415a2db7073450cf23f14590e2d8d99843c1d771ea249ab30c02f3bcf0d",
      "target_id": "XML:2657373"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00005",
      "text": "至己目规定的违法行为为最近三年内）因相同违法行为受到罚款处分的情形。",
      "source_hash": "c10658b85f999b743e4b7f2f8aa638d6a0868c9d80b4f8aa83c65d58abb6ca71",
      "target_id": "XML:2657374"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00006",
      "text": "此时，期间的计算以就该违法行为受到罚款处分之日以及处分后再次实施同一",
      "source_hash": "bc341af6c84d35508e1b868718b26e3847b21ef22d3bdb9a7cc6910d9253844b",
      "target_id": "XML:2657375"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00007",
      "text": "违法行为而被查获之日",
      "source_hash": "a8df4eb03f04f0a4c80e259c5f0bcc9b7ecc25882ff492de4b52db2319a5d673",
      "target_id": "XML:2657376"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00008",
      "text": "为准。",
      "source_hash": "8290dd0f5fdee25cc1ff59e8aaf8db1aaa40853a401189ca0ab19d381f140a5f",
      "target_id": "XML:2657377"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00009",
      "text": "乙. 依甲目作出加重罚款处分时，加重处分适用的次数为该违法行为发生前",
      "source_hash": "28427a9884ed513dd4321efe166cf34c52bfab835193a1e9c6d06ad75605857e",
      "target_id": "XML:2657378"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00010",
      "text": "已受罚款处分的次数（在甲目规定期间内有两次以上罚款处分的，",
      "source_hash": "229ebd824e8ed5d2f241bad75f8b50069d7a0a54a89064e5b08e3ee0c66af58c",
      "target_id": "XML:2657379"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00011",
      "text": "以其中较高的次数为准）的下一次。",
      "source_hash": "fde04a0f554335ad66c97ccfa50ef6e607943069a8eef47524bc2ecd450db5ff",
      "target_id": "XML:2657380"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00012",
      "text": "丙. 在下列任一情形下，罚款征收机关可以将第二项具体标准规定的",
      "source_hash": "a110e297f1f94fe0843c49b3d5e5b561ddaae47c7f302d2fc6526f1b94c6fc52",
      "target_id": "XML:2657381"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00013",
      "text": "罚款金额在二分之一的幅度内减轻。但是，违法行为人",
      "source_hash": "946d0d71608f125f72727b9c29698932642f3a6ad1d7d10a3b5d6b620819e15c",
      "target_id": "XML:2657382"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00014",
      "text": "拖欠罚款的，不得减轻。",
      "source_hash": "23dffcebe1098143d4a9902e3b248cf0cec9c2ab6537da4302f519e2297ad6ed",
      "target_id": "XML:2657383"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00015",
      "text": "1) 违法行为人符合《秩序违反行为规制法施行令》第二条之二第一款各项规定的任一情形",
      "source_hash": "8c89c331e22d9750cb662004c34ddef1dbacd609ac96bc533e5c66ceec57e797",
      "target_id": "XML:2657384"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00022",
      "text": "丁. 在下列任一情形下，罚款征收机关可以将第二项具体标准规定的",
      "source_hash": "256284c6a4f3b0c96b06cc4c55e328ee31f62dc4af3e086128c806b25dd9728e",
      "target_id": "XML:2657391"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00023",
      "text": "罚款金额在二分之一的幅度内增加。但即使增加，",
      "source_hash": "b0828ff5ce6503803dc23d75b2bcb1706f31548c9b9e6fed32246c752b7ff27d",
      "target_id": "XML:2657392"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00032",
      "text": "罚款",
      "source_hash": "79e8856468966f56cc9f74e5a890e3845e1917465a0b761a28de9183715319f5",
      "target_id": "XML:2657401"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00035",
      "text": "第三次及以上",
      "source_hash": "4d2730da32a949c58cda8c1c5b24c4538e84d2d6301e36a1b60dde4b57d89792",
      "target_id": "XML:2657404"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00039",
      "text": "200万韩元",
      "source_hash": "ec32def14caae856350cdc14244dd3cc180dfc63aee66aad0d0de00b92811a2c",
      "target_id": "XML:2657408"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00049",
      "text": "200万韩元",
      "source_hash": "ec32def14caae856350cdc14244dd3cc180dfc63aee66aad0d0de00b92811a2c",
      "target_id": "XML:2657418"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36427-zh-00057",
      "text": "200万韩元",
      "source_hash": "ec32def14caae856350cdc14244dd3cc180dfc63aee66aad0d0de00b92811a2c",
      "target_id": "XML:2657426"
    }
  ],
